#: ../../source/docs/common-pixhawk-wiring-and-quick-start.rst:81
#: 1e51bbf8b4b14230abf2b3979cd66969
msgid ""
"The :ref:`3DR UBlox GPS + Compass Module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-"
"compass-module>` is the recommended GPS for Pixhawk on ArduPilot.  The GPS "
"ports are connected with the six-position DF13 cable, and the MAG port is "
"connected to the I2C port with the four-position DF13 cable."
msgstr ""
":ref:`3DR UBlox GPS + 罗盘模块 <common-installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>`"
" 是 ArduPilot 上 Pixhawk 的推荐 GPS。GPS 端口使用六芯 DF13 线缆连接，MAG 端口使用四芯 DF13 线缆连接到 "
"I2C 端口。"

